        {
            "title": "Demo version of hot air balloon flight",
            "date": "2020-12-22 15:26:09",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/3917534300067081582",
            "notes": "[h1]Hot air balloon flight[/h1]\n\n[url=https://store.steampowered.com/app/1483550/Axe_Gang/]Demo[/url]\n\nSee how Axe Gang unfolds graphics in a hot air balloon ride through an old canyon - one of the game's locations. You'll use the same balloon to travel around the game's world. Control the mechanisms of the balloon using the levers and the steering wheel.\n\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39250482/92c36ed4016ea84211d46b323db75dccd4f39246.gif[/img]\n\nShare your experience. We want to get as much feedback as possible to make the game better.\n\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39250482/ce28202955902281ae92078e09695f8777d7179e.gif[/img]\n\nThanks for testing!"
        }
